msgstr ""
"1. Installare <a href=\"https://freeotp.github.io/\">FreeOTP</a> o <a "
"href=\"https://www.pcworld.com/article/3225913/what-is-two-factor-"
"authentication-and-which-2fa-apps-are-best.html\">any\n"
"altri due fattori di autenticazione app</a> che supporta TOTP."

#. Status: mt
#. Phase: 1
#: templates/mfa.html:65
