"<tt>~/.ssh/authorized_keys</tt>\n"
"        of target user on the backup server specified above. That way "
"you'll enable secure and\n"
"        passwordless authentication from your Trixiemail server and your"
" backup server."
msgstr ""
"Copia la chiave SSH pubblica sopra e incollala in "
